      "jp": "ハロウィンに貴賤無し――。<interval=0.8>\nカボチャはカボチャの上にカボチャを作らず、<interval=0.4>\nカボチャの下にカボチャを作らず……<interval=0.4>也。",
      "jp_sha256": "cc7ca04d6645680cdc8579b0685df10d243b417b33ce5c1a3e7569f7678bf0dd",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "할로윈에 귀천은 없다――.<interval=0.8>\n호박은 호박 위에 호박을 만들지 않고,<interval=0.4>\n호박 아래에 호박을 만들지 않는다……<interval=0.4>이니라.",
      "message_index_0based": 10,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 62,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b013-20261109-same-model-pass2-5adf61fa",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "1a377c37102d4f2d2d92058e7589b5c127ad88e5a6105cd73b477f98138ac95e:000002_8024177645659696231:g0:r61",
